silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor_5_Felis_catus#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode5 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode5 is the Felis catus / TSN 183798 taxonomy source leg of D_Mittens that refines the cat classification without replacing the apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Felis_catus', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
